	(lib_symbols)
	(text "CAPTURE PLAN\n\nEight 3.3 V UART signals with 33 ohm configuration footprints and test pads\nCAM1 52/51; CAM2 50/49; CAM3 34/33; CAM4 30/29\nSN74LVC125APWRG3 four-way SYNC fan-out from GPIO32 / JP1 pin 19\n33 ohm branch source resistors, isolation links and test pads\nCAMn_SYNC to XIAO D1 / GPIO2\nCAMn_FSIN, CAMn_PWDN and CAMn_RESET future-interposer pads\n\nRoute every branch over continuous L2 ground and validate concurrent 921600 baud."
